# OPTIONAL — disabled by default (same as the original app's cron1hEnabled: false).
#
# This file is named ".yml.optional" so GitHub does NOT run it as-is.
# To enable a 1-hour cadence ALONGSIDE the 30-minute pipeline:
#   1. Decide if you actually want two alerts overlapping every hour (the 30m
#      job already covers :00 and :30 — a separate 1h job on the same symbols
#      is usually redundant unless you point it at DIFFERENT symbols).
#   2. Rename this file to pipeline-1h.yml (drop the .optional extension) and
#      move it into .github/workflows/ if it isn't already there.
#   3. Commit and push.
